          "type": "reasoning",
          "text": "Create a Python script that:\n1. Loads digits\n2. Hand-implements PCA via SVD or eigen decomposition of covariance\n3. Takes top 10 components\n4. Verifies against sklearn PCA\n\nWrite to project root maybe pca_digits.py, and notes.\n\nLet me write script. Verification: compare explained variance ratio, components up to sign, reconstructed error, projections. Also maybe compare eigen-decomposition vs SVD. Print results.\n\nMake figure: scree plot or reconstruction. Save to figs.\n\nLet me write.",
          "time": {
